# Magic Scarf — WizCommerce Storefront Rebuild

A ship-ready, single-file responsive prototype rebuilt from the live audit of [magicscarf.com](https://www.magicscarf.com/stores/eol/) and styled to WizCommerce's older-B2B wholesale standards.

## How to run

Double-click `index.html` — that's it. No build step, no server, no dependencies. Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS only.

