## How the site is structured

The site uses a **hash router** inside one HTML file. Reachable views:

- `#/` — Home
- `#/catalog` — Full Magic Scarf Catalog (17 categories)
- `#/c/<slug>` — Category PLP (e.g. `#/c/ponchos`)
- `#/p/<sku>` — Product PDP (e.g. `#/p/8672`)
- `#/cart` · `#/account` · `#/show-schedule` · `#/contact` · `#/sale` · `#/faire`

Login and Apply-for-Wholesale are modals overlaying any view.

## Browser support

Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Edge — last 2 versions. Mobile Safari + Chrome on Android. Older-user-friendly: respects `prefers-reduced-motion`, body type at 17px floor, primary buttons ≥52px tall.
